dreamdump (0.6.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial package: upstream's static release binaries for amd64 and arm64,
    at the dreamdump release MPF bundles. dreamdump(1) is generated at build
    time from the source of the same release; the build fails on a SCSI
    opcode outside INQUIRY / SET CD SPEED / READ CD, because the package
    ships without cap_sys_rawio.

